{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23315","headline":"湖上招客送春泛舟 · 白居易","name":"湖上招客送春泛舟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲送残春招酒伴，客中谁最有风情。\n两瓶箬下新开得，一曲霓裳初教成。\n排比管弦行翠袖，指麾船舫点红旌。\n慢牵好向湖心去，恰似菱花镜上行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23315.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23315","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}